# Cloudflare static asset headers. adapter-cloudflare copies this file into the build and appends its own block
# (hashed `/_app/immutable/*` files, which include every screenshot: one year, immutable). Everything else is served
# with `max-age=0, must-revalidate` by default, i.e. one revalidation round trip per file and navigation.
# Fonts are not hashed but never change in place: a changed font gets a new file name (update app.html and layout.css).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=86400
